                                "sense_id": "8051e458-ec03-3753-8092-f7fdee990e7c",
                                "text": "We ducked and dodged law, and jackboys, only to hand our hard earned cash over to another hustler; a hustler greater than us."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "842b0656-f361-4fe1-ad40-c8f071f98907",
                                "sense_id": "8051e458-ec03-3753-8092-f7fdee990e7c",
                                "text": "Ordell asked one of his jackboys to get him a car with keys in it and leave it in the Ocean Mall parking lot over by the beach. The jackboy asked him what kind of car he wanted. Ordell said, 'One has a big trunk with a shotgun in it.' He liked jackboys because they were crazy. They made their living ripping off street dealers for their blow and change and busting into crack houses with assault weapons."
                            },
                            {
