                                "sense_id": "8051e458-ec03-3753-8092-f7fdee990e7c",
                                "text": "\"Get you stupid ass over there by the chip display and don't move,\" the robber instructed as he positioned himself to where he could see both David and Nicole with minimal movement. That act alone let David know the guy in the Oakland Raiders pullover was an experienced jackboy."
